      "writtenOn": "2025-07-31T22:57:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Proposing\n`source_set(\"devtool_record\") { ... }`\n\nand in `dawn/native/BUILD.gn`:\n```\nsource_set(\"sources\"){\n  if (dawn_enable_devtool_record) {\n    deps +\u003d [ \"${dawn_root}/src/dawn/devtool:devtool_record\" ]\n  }\n}\n```",
